<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Save Trees</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #e8f5e9;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #2e7d32;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 80%;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        img {
            width: 70%;
            max-width: 700px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #1b5e20;
        }

        ul {
            text-align: left;
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #2e7d32;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>🌳 Save Trees, Save Life 🌳</h1>
    <p>Trees are the lungs of our planet. Let's protect them!</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

    <!-- Replace the image URL with any image you like -->
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1466611653911-95081537e5b7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
         alt="Person planting a tree">

    <h2>7 Ways to Save Trees</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>🌱 Plant more trees in your community.</li>
        <li>📄 Reduce paper usage by using digital documents.</li>
        <li>♻ Recycle paper and cardboard products.</li>
        <li>🔥 Prevent forest fires by following safety rules.</li>
        <li>🌳 Support tree plantation and conservation programs.</li>
        <li>🚫 Avoid cutting trees unnecessarily.</li>
        <li>📢 Spread awareness about the importance of trees.</li>
    </ul>

</div>

<footer>
    <p>"The best time to plant a tree was 20 years ago. The second best time is today."</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
